From: Mesh-LLM CI <ci@mesh-llm.local>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 1970 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 13/81] skippy: annotate dots1 graph semantics

Generated by tools/skippy-stage-rewriter from compiler-proven builder
shapes. Auxiliary sidecars and whole-model multi-domain graphs are proven
separately and remain outside the primary decoder stage interval.

diff --git a/src/models/dots1.cpp b/src/models/dots1.cpp
index c2fa96560..92b0ea11f 100644
--- a/src/models/dots1.cpp
+++ b/src/models/dots1.cpp
@@ -91,6 +91,8 @@ llama_model_dots1::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) :
     ggml_tensor * inp_out_ids = build_inp_out_ids();
 
     for (int il = 0; il < n_layer; ++il) {
+        begin_block(inpL, il);
+
         ggml_tensor * inpSA = inpL;
 
         // norm
@@ -173,6 +175,7 @@ llama_model_dots1::graph::graph(const llm_graph_params & params) :
 
         // input for next layer
         inpL = cur;
+        end_block(inpL, il);
     }
     cur = inpL;
 
